#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility.rst:21
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The *Utility* effects category contains useful effects/tools for getting "
#| "information about your video material rather than manipulating the "
#| "imagery. The exception is :ref:`effects-timeout_indicator` - it can be "
#| "used to add countdown or count-up indicator to your video."
msgid ""
"The *Utility* effects category contains useful effects/tools for getting "
"information about your video material rather than manipulating the imagery. "
"The exception is :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/"
"timeout_indicator` - it can be used to add countdown or count-up indicator "
"to your video."
msgstr ""
"A categoría de efectos de *Utilidade* contén efectos útiles e ferramentas "
"para obter información sobre o material de vídeos, máis que para manipular a "
"imaxe. A única excepción é o :ref:`indicador de tempo límite <effects-"
"timeout_indicator>`, que pode usarse para engadir un indicador de conta "
"atrás ou adiante ao vídeo."

